ormat="epo"><addressbook><name>SUMITOMO CHEMICAL CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITO, NOBUAKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUMITOMO CHEMICAL COMPANY, LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MITO NOBUAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITO, NOBUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A herbicide composition containing as the active ingredients both an ester of 2-[2-chloro-4-fluoro-5-{3-methyl-2,6-dioxo-4-(trifluoromethyl)-1,2,3,6-tetrahydropyrimidin-1-yl}phenoxy]propionic acid, and glyphosate or a salt thereof; and a method for weeding by applying the composition to weeds. This composition is synergistically enhanced in the herbicidal effect as compared with the cases wherein the above active ingredients are used each alone, and therefore can kill various weeds effectively.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une composition herbicide comportant comme principes actifs: un ester de l'acide 2-[2-chloro-4-fluoro-5-{3-méthyl-2,6-dioxo-4-trifluorométhyl)1,2,3,6-tétrahydropyrimidin-1-yl}phénoxy]propionique, et un glyphosate ou l'un de ses sels; et sur un procédé de désherbage par application de ladite composition. Cette composition agissant synergétiquement par comparaison avec ses principes actifs utilisés séparément, détruit efficacement les mauvaises herbes.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to